Type: Package
Package: nmtools
Title: NM Personal Toolbox With Varied Function
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Nicolas", "Moiroux", , "nicolas.moiroux@ird.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6755-6167"))
Description: The box includes a function to calculate Fisher's alpha diversity index with minimum data, 
    a function to interpolate missing data in
    METAR (meteorological data from airport stations) time series and a
    set of functions to query and download ephemeris for the Sun and Moon
    using the NASA JPL Horizons API and to calculate ground-based
    illuminance.
